orward \"Vehicle Type\" or \"Vehicle Info\" input.\n\n\n**Reviewing Tech Stack**\n\nI\'m now investigating the technology stack, specifically focusing on animation libraries. I\'m checking if `framer-motion` or `motion` is installed in `package.json`, as the goal is to implement beautiful layout animations within the booking form. I also need to verify Vite\'s compatibility with these animation libraries.\n\n\n"
