    modified_response: "I have successfully updated and polished the detailing application, transforming it into an elite, custom-branded mobile detailing portal. \n\n### What was done:\n\n*   **Distinctive Premium Typography**: Swapped the generic layout font for an intentional luxury pairing: **Playfair Display** (an elegant editorial display serif) for headings, paired with **Plus Jakarta Sans** (a clean, geometric architectural sans-serif) for body copy. This instantly removes the \"standard template\" look.\n*   **Peak SEO Configuration**: Upgraded `index.html` with robust local search terms, geo-regions, keywords, and description tags targeting *Kennesaw*, *Acworth*, *Marietta*, and *Cobb County GA* to ensure maximum crawlability and performance on the Google Search Console.\n*   **Aesthetic Cleansing (Anti-AI-Slop & Zero Emojis/Sparkles)**: Purged all cheap AI-looking sparkle icons, emoji symbols, and generic bullet icons. All controls are now styled cleanly with high-end typography and classic vector elements (like simple checks and clean arrows).\n*   **Dedicated Work Gallery Page (No Popups)**: Created a completely new navigation tab and page for a fully showcased **Showroom Gallery** featuring your real-world imagery with exact 1-sentence descriptions and flashy titles matching your service outcomes:\n    *   **\"Surgical Deep Carpet & Floor Extraction\"** \342\200\224 `IMG_7813.jpeg` (showcasing carpet cleaning)\n    *   **\"Mirror-Sheen Piano Black Polish\"** \342\200\224 `IMG_0663.jpeg` (showcasing piano black restoration)\n    *   **\"Showroom Reflection & Clear Coat Depth\"** \342\200\224 `IMG_0648.jpeg`\n    *   **\"Hydrophobic Shell & Ultraviolet Armor\"** \342\200\224 `IMG_7812.jpeg`\n    *   **\"Clinical Alloy Wheel & Caliper Revital\"** \342\200\224 `IMG_7815.jpeg`\n    *   **\"Pore-Cleansing Cabin Leather Preservation\"** \342\200\224 `IMG_0659.jpeg`\n    *   *Removed all zoom popup modals and long-winded paragraphs relative to images, keeping descriptions strictly to 1 sentence.*\n*   **Simplified Booking Form**: Swapped the Year/Make/Model fields for a single, direct `\"Vehicle Type *\"` input (e.g. SUV, Sedan, Truck, Minivan). Smoothly animated form transitions and validation states using high-performance `motion/react` fade transitions.\n*   **Transparent Pricing Estimates**: Added clear notices across the Services and Booking screens outlining that all listed quotes represent estimated base rates that vary model-to-model depending on the vehicle\'s **size** and **dirtiness**.\n*   **Custom Footer Attribute**: Removed the \"co-founded\" tag and updated the footer to cleanly read: *\"Website created by Neil Menepdar with SEO.\"*\n"
